== X1 the token generators as unitary conjugations
CONFIRMED X1 U_J unitary; Ad(U_J): sigma_x -> sigma_y -> sigma_z -> sigma_x; Ad(1 x U_J) = actT cyc3 on all 16 basis tables; Ad(1 x exp(-i t sigma_z/2)) = actT R_z(t) at cos t = 3/5
== X2 the finite clause: order 384, phi0 unreachable
CONFIRMED X2 |<cnot, actT R_z(pi/2), actT cyc3>| = 384; phi0 (|phi0|^2 = 16, table not rank one) is carried to a rank-one table by no element; the Bell state by some; product tables are rank one -- order 384, phi0 reachable by 0 elements, Bell by 192
== X3 theta0/pi irrational, cos theta0 = 3/5
CONFIRMED X3 (2+i)^2 = 3+4i, N(2+i) = 5 prime, (2+i)/(2-i) = (3+4i)/5 is neither a unit nor a Gaussian integer, so ((3+4i)/5)^n != 1 for all n >= 1; no R_z(theta0)^n = 1 for n <= 3000 -- ratio 3/5 + 4*I/5
== X4 the reachability word on my own instances
CONFIRMED X4 CNOT (1 x W) CNOT = P0 x W + P1 x X W X symbolically; on three Gaussian-rational states the word (1 x W') CNOT (1 x W) CNOT carries (a|0> + b|1>) x |0> to psi exactly, W and W' unitary -- kappas ['1/2 + I/2', '0', '2*sqrt(5)*I/5']
== X5 the cone step on an instance
CONFIRMED X5 a PSD Gaussian-rational 4x4 matrix is an exact sum of four rank-one terms (LDL), and v^* rho(omega) v = ipW(omega, table(vv^*))/4 on an instance -- pivots ['2', '-2*(1/2 - I/2)*(1/2 + I/2) + 3', '2 - 1/(-2*(1/2 - I/2)*(1/2 + I/2) + 3)', '-(1 - I + I*(-1/2 + I/2)/(-2*(1/2 - I/2)*(1/2 + I/2) + 3))*(1 - I*(-1/2 - I/2)/(-2*(1/2 - I/2)*(1/2 + I/2) + 3) + I)/(2 - 1/(-2*(1/2 - I/2)*(1/2 + I/2) + 3)) - (-1/2 - I/2)*(-1/2 + I/2)/(-2*(1/2 - I/2)*(1/2 + I/2) + 3) + 5/2'], v^* rho v = 19
