CONFIRMED X6 6144 monomial unitaries: H-DYN holds for exactly 96 (scalar diagonal), giving 24 distinct maps; Householder H = 1 - 2vv^T/25 orthogonal and violates H-DYN on all 16 units -- unitaries 96, maps 24, bad units 16
